{"abstract":[{"text":"Several nouns as one — “a sword, a lamp, and some scales” — carrying","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the number the whole phrase has rather than the number any one of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them has.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"nouns"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","text":"GameText","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","text":"Noun","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","text":"GameText","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","text":"Noun","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The phrases to join, in the order they should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"nouns"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One noun standing for all of them."}]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TextAndRandomness"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That number is the reason this is here and not at the call site."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"English agrees with the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"list"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", and a list is plural two ways: when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it holds more than one thing, "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"or"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" when the only thing it holds is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"itself plural. Counting alone gets the second wrong, and the engine"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"got it wrong — one plural thing in a box printed “In the hamper is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"some scales.” A game re-voicing that line would have had to re-derive"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the rule from scratch and could have made the same mistake; this is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the rule written once, in the type that exists to own it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An empty list is plural (“none of them are here”) and renders as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"empty phrase. No stock line calls one with nothing in it — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"callers all branch on empty first, with a line of their own — but a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"game’s might, and silently reading as singular would be the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defect one case further out."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameText\/Noun"]]},"metad